{'symbol': 'FICO', 'date': '2022-12-14 08:00:00', 'title': 'NEW FICO REPORT: FRAUD PROTECTION IS TOP PRIORITY FOR CANADIANS WHEN THEY CHOOSE A FINANCIAL PROVIDER', 'text': 'TORONTO--( BUSINESS WIRE )--GLOBAL ANALYTICS SOFTWARE PLATFORM PROVIDER, FICO, RELEASED THE CONSUMER FRAUD SURVEY 2022 RESEARCH REPORT, WHICH EXPLORES THE SHIFT IN CONSUMER EXPECTATIONS ON HOW FINANCIAL INSTITUTIONS MANAGE FRAUD. THE REPORT SURVEYED MORE THAN 14,000 GLOBAL CONSUMERS ACROSS 14 DIFFERENT COUNTRIES WORLDWIDE, INCLUDING CANADA. OVERALL, THE SURVEY FOUND THAT CONSUMERS EXPECT A STRONG FRAUD STANCE FROM FINANCIAL INSTITUTIONS AS PART OF THE CUSTOMER EXPERIENCE; SUCCESSFUL FRAUD PROTECTION CAN ATTRACT NEW CUSTOMERS AND ENHANCE CUSTOMER SATISFACTION.'}